{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":2240,"height":190,"text":"# Pact · Final Draft\n**Grok bot agent · Circle + Arc** · Entering **Consumer Applications** and **Best Use of Circle's Arc** · ElevenLabs voice is optional, added later\nDay: [[2026-11-12]] · [[00_ubc_2026]] · Hacking Nov 13 to 20 · **Due Fri Nov 20, 12 PM CST** · Finals Nov 21, Austin"},
		{"id":"lane-rory","type":"group","x":-30,"y":290,"width":2300,"height":540,"label":"Rory · Agent + Blockchain","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"lab-rory","type":"text","x":0,"y":360,"width":340,"height":440,"text":"# Rory\nAgent + Blockchain","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"c-rory-0","type":"text","x":380,"y":360,"width":340,"height":440,"text":"### Google login and wallets\n- Make the Google OAuth client and give Vamsi the keys\n- Circle wallets on the Arc test network, made by our app\n- Fund each demo wallet with test USDC from the Circle faucet","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"c-rory-1","type":"text","x":760,"y":360,"width":340,"height":440,"text":"### Grok bot in the chat (MCP), our main agent\n- Set up the MCP server with read chat and post message tools\n- Prompt Grok to spot when the group agrees and sum it up\n- Agent replies as a card in the chat, not plain text","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"c-rory-2","type":"text","x":1140,"y":360,"width":340,"height":440,"text":"### Agent checks the plan and finds 2 to 3 options\n- Check budget, dates, number of people and place\n- Demo listings for Austin hotels and rides, no real booking\n- Return options with price per person and a link","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"c-rory-3","type":"text","x":1520,"y":360,"width":340,"height":440,"text":"### Arc payment and split contract\n- First: one USDC transfer on the Arc test network through Circle\n- Then: a small Solidity split contract that holds, releases, refunds and announces \"SharePaid\"\n- Fallback by Nov 17: direct transfers plus Circle's webhook","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"c-rory-4","type":"text","x":1900,"y":360,"width":340,"height":440,"text":"### Demo video and pitch\n- Script the Austin trip: 4 friends, 3 stays, all pay\n- Record the 2 to 3 min video by Nov 19\n- Practise the live pitch for Nov 21","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"lane-nihar","type":"group","x":-30,"y":900,"width":2300,"height":340,"label":"Nihar · Frontend","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"lab-nihar","type":"text","x":0,"y":970,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"# Nihar\nFrontend","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"c-nihar-0","type":"text","x":380,"y":970,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Landing, sign in, invite\n- Black and gold landing with the 3D gold hero, live on Vercel day 1","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"c-nihar-1","type":"text","x":760,"y":970,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Chat screen\n- Show agent messages as cards with buttons (Agree, Vote)","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"c-nihar-2","type":"text","x":1140,"y":970,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Options and voting\n- Option cards with price per person, link and vote count","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"c-nihar-3","type":"text","x":1520,"y":970,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### \"Pay my share\" and live progress\n- Bar that fills live, \"3 of 4 paid\", with a 10 min timer","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"c-nihar-4","type":"text","x":1900,"y":970,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Receipt and summary screens\n- One calm screen: what was booked, what I paid, my receipt","color":"#9B5DE5"},
		{"id":"lane-vamsi","type":"group","x":-30,"y":1310,"width":2300,"height":340,"label":"Vamsi · Backend (Supabase)","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"lab-vamsi","type":"text","x":0,"y":1380,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"# Vamsi\nBackend (Supabase)","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"c-vamsi-0","type":"text","x":380,"y":1380,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Google sign-in\n- Turn on the Google provider in Supabase Auth with Rory's keys","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"c-vamsi-1","type":"text","x":760,"y":1380,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Pacts, members, roles\n- Host approves anyone who handles money","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"c-vamsi-2","type":"text","x":1140,"y":1380,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Realtime chat\n- Messages table with Realtime and row level security per pact","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"c-vamsi-3","type":"text","x":1520,"y":1380,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Votes, options, spend caps\n- Block a share if it is over that person's cap","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"c-vamsi-4","type":"text","x":1900,"y":1380,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Mark Paid from the webhook only\n- Edge function that takes Dimple's events and sets the share to Paid","color":"#2BB673"},
		{"id":"lane-dimple","type":"group","x":-30,"y":1720,"width":2300,"height":340,"label":"Dimple · Onchain data (QuickNode)","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"lab-dimple","type":"text","x":0,"y":1790,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"# Dimple\nOnchain data (QuickNode)","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"c-dimple-0","type":"text","x":380,"y":1790,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Confirm QuickNode is free\n- Check the free tier includes Streams on the Arc test network","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"c-dimple-1","type":"text","x":760,"y":1790,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Stream watches our payments\n- Filter on our Pact contract only","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"c-dimple-2","type":"text","x":1140,"y":1790,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Send events to Vamsi's webhook\n- Send each \"SharePaid\" event: pact, person, amount","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"c-dimple-3","type":"text","x":1520,"y":1790,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### Check each receipt\n- Match pact, person and amount before Paid","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"c-dimple-4","type":"text","x":1900,"y":1790,"width":340,"height":240,"text":"### README with contract addresses\n- Setup steps, a simple architecture picture, every contract address","color":"#F28C28"},
		{"id":"g-week","type":"group","x":-30,"y":2150,"width":2300,"height":250,"label":"The week"},
		{"id":"d-0","type":"text","x":0,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 13\nSign in, deploy"},
		{"id":"d-1","type":"text","x":282,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 14\nFirst payment"},
		{"id":"d-2","type":"text","x":564,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 15\nAgree and vote"},
		{"id":"d-3","type":"text","x":846,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 16\nQuickNode stream"},
		{"id":"d-4","type":"text","x":1128,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 17\nConnect it all"},
		{"id":"d-5","type":"text","x":1410,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 18\nPolish"},
		{"id":"d-6","type":"text","x":1692,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 19 to 20\nTest and submit"},
		{"id":"d-7","type":"text","x":1974,"y":2220,"width":262,"height":150,"text":"### Nov 21\nPitch in Austin"},
		{"id":"rules","type":"text","x":0,"y":2470,"width":2240,"height":150,"text":"## Rules\nNo \"Paid\" until it is checked on chain · Users never see crypto · Nothing is bought without a group vote · Test money only · $0 spend"},
		{"id":"g-build","type":"group","x":-80,"y":260,"width":2400,"height":2420,"label":"WHAT WE BUILD · hackathon"},
		{"id":"u0","type":"text","x":2640,"y":320,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 1. Sign in with Google","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u1","type":"text","x":2640,"y":520,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 2. Create a pact or join by link. Pick a role","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u2","type":"text","x":2640,"y":720,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 3. Chat: dates, budget, place, how many people","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u3","type":"text","x":2640,"y":920,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 4. Everyone taps Agree","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u4","type":"text","x":2640,"y":1120,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 5. Agent checks: is it possible? Suggests changes","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u5","type":"text","x":2640,"y":1320,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 6. Accept, propose a new one, or deny","color":"#E9C46A"},
		{"id":"u6","type":"text","x":2640,"y":1520,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 7. Agent shows options and the best plan","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u7","type":"text","x":2640,"y":1720,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 8. Approve, look for more, or deny","color":"#E9C46A"},
		{"id":"u8","type":"text","x":2640,"y":1920,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 9. Tap \"Pay my share\". Split it, one person pays, or pay back later","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u9","type":"text","x":2640,"y":2120,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 10. Watch \"3 of 4 paid\". Booking held 10 minutes","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u10","type":"text","x":2640,"y":2320,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 11. Booked. Verified receipt for everyone","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"u11","type":"text","x":2640,"y":2520,"width":560,"height":120,"text":"### 12. Pact Summary: who paid what, what is next","color":"#8A8F98"},
		{"id":"g-user","type":"group","x":2380,"y":260,"width":1120,"height":2420,"label":"WHAT A USER SEES · the app"},
		{"id":"b0","type":"text","x":3640,"y":320,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 1. Grok reads the chat through our MCP server","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"b1","type":"text","x":3640,"y":681,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 2. Grok finds options and asks the group to pay","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"b2","type":"text","x":3640,"y":1042,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 3. Each person taps \"Approve my share\"","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"b3","type":"text","x":3640,"y":1403,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 4. Circle sends their test USDC on Arc to the Pact contract","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"b4","type":"text","x":3640,"y":1764,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 5. The contract records \"SharePaid\" on Arc","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"b5","type":"text","x":3640,"y":2125,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 6. QuickNode sees it and tells our webhook","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"b6","type":"text","x":3640,"y":2486,"width":560,"height":150,"text":"### 7. The share shows Paid in the chat","color":"#2F6FED"},
		{"id":"q-grok","type":"text","x":4300,"y":320,"width":600,"height":360,"text":"## Grok bot · thinks\n- Our main agent, in the chat\n- Only calls tools on our MCP server\n- Never touches money","color":"3"},
		{"id":"q-circle","type":"text","x":4300,"y":1298,"width":600,"height":360,"text":"## Circle · does\n- Makes each user's wallet\n- Sends their USDC\n- Fees are paid in USDC on Arc, no second token","color":"4"},
		{"id":"q-quick","type":"text","x":4300,"y":2020,"width":600,"height":360,"text":"## QuickNode · checks\n- Watches our contract on Arc\n- Paid only when Arc says so\n- Backup: Circle's own webhook","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g-how","type":"group","x":3580,"y":260,"width":1380,"height":2420,"label":"HOW THE AGENT AND BLOCKCHAIN WORK · Circle + Arc"},
		{"id":"p-0","type":"text","x":0,"y":2840,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### Split it\nEach person taps \"Approve my share\". Cap checked first, then it goes into the pot","color":"5"},
		{"id":"p-1","type":"text","x":380,"y":2840,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### One person pays\nOne member covers it all. Pact tracks what each person owes them","color":"5"},
		{"id":"p-2","type":"text","x":760,"y":2840,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### Pay back later\nOne pays first, the rest pay them back in the app. Each payback is checked on chain","color":"5"},
		{"id":"p-3","type":"text","x":1140,"y":2840,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### 10 minute hold\nBooking is held while shares come in. Not all paid in time: everyone is refunded","color":"5"},
		{"id":"p-4","type":"text","x":1520,"y":2840,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### Drop out\nTheir share comes back, the rest is re-split, and the others approve the new amount","color":"5"},
		{"id":"p-5","type":"text","x":1900,"y":2840,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### Receipts\nEvery payment has a checkable receipt. Keep the lodging one for the UBC travel grant","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g-pay","type":"group","x":-80,"y":2780,"width":2400,"height":420,"label":"PAYMENTS · how money moves"},
		{"id":"budget","type":"text","x":2460,"y":2840,"width":1920,"height":300,"text":"| Item | Cost |\n|---|---|\n| Vercel (Hobby), Supabase (free), GitHub, Arc test network, Circle wallets (testnet) | $0 |\n| QuickNode Streams | $0 if the free plan covers Arc test network Streams. Check on Nov 13 |\n| Grok API (grok-4.1-fast, $0.20 in / $0.50 out per 1M tokens) | About $1 to $5. $0 with free credits |\n| ElevenLabs voice | Optional, add later. $0 on the free tier |\n| Domain, Obsidian Publish | Skip. Use the vercel.app link and an exported image |"},
		{"id":"budget-total","type":"text","x":4420,"y":2840,"width":480,"height":300,"text":"## Total: $0 to $5\n- Only Grok can cost money\n- Set a $5 spend limit in the xAI console\n- Real money (mainnet) is after the hackathon","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g-budget","type":"group","x":2400,"y":2780,"width":2560,"height":420,"label":"BUDGET · as free as possible"}
	],
